# Simplified Chinese (zh-CN) catalog for the AI onboarding and plan comparison.
#
# Plan names, product names (Zed) and the dollar amounts are deliberately left
# untranslated: the amounts are what the account is actually billed in, and the
# plan names are how they appear on the account.

## Plan entitlements

t-2-000-accepted-edit-predictions = 2,000 次已接受的编辑预测
unlimited-edit-predictions = 编辑预测无限制
unlimited-prompts-with-your-ai-api-keys = 使用自己的 AI API 密钥时提示词无限制
unlimited-use-of-external-agents = 不限量使用外部智能体
no-credit-card-required = 无需信用卡
try-it-out-for-14-days-no-credit-card-required = 免费试用 14 天，无需信用卡

## Token allowances and billing

tokens-in-the-zed-agent = Zed 智能体中的 token
t-5-of-tokens-in-zed-agent = Zed 智能体中价值 $5 的 token
t-10-of-tokens-in-zed-agent = Zed 智能体中价值 $10 的 token
t-20-of-tokens-in-zed-agent = Zed 智能体中价值 $20 的 token
usage-based-billing = 按用量计费
usage-based-billing-beyond-5 = 超出 $5 后按用量计费
optional-credit-packs-for-additional-usage = 可另购额度包以追加用量
